---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Refurbished Gearboxes | Elmech Engineering" description="Expert refurbishment and overhaul services for industrial gearboxes.">
  <section class="relative py-24 border-b border-slate-200 overflow-hidden bg-slate-900">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504917595217-d4dc5ebe6122?q=80&w=2000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Industrial Gearbox Refurbishment" class="w-full h-full object-cover filter brightness-90 contrast-105" />
    </div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-[1px] z-0"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/50 via-slate-900/30 to-slate-900/60 z-0"></div>
    
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 text-center">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/15 border border-white/25 text-blue-300 font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm">
          Overhaul & Precision Rebuild
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white mb-4 tracking-tight drop-shadow-lg">Refurbishment <span class="text-blue-400">Services</span></h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-200 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto drop-shadow-md">
          Breathe new life into your existing heavy-duty equipment with our comprehensive overhaul and recertification services.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-slate-50 min-h-screen">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">Precision Overhaul & Gearbox Refurbishment</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6">
          With extensive hands-on experience in gear cutting, tooth generation, and power transmission repair, <strong>Elmech Engineering</strong> provides complete refurbishment, overhaul, and performance recertification for industrial reduction units of all makes and models.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Every refurbished unit undergoes complete dismantling, ultrasonic cleaning, metallurgical inspection of worm and wheel profiles, replacement of high-precision bearings and branded oil seals, followed by full no-load spin testing for noise, backlash, and thermal dissipation.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-8">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 font-black">1</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Tooth Re-Hobbing & Grinding</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">Replacement or re-profiling of worn phosphorous bronze worm wheels and carburized worm shafts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 font-black">2</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Housing & Bearing Boring</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">Precision line boring of cast iron and fabricated cases to restore exact centerline alignment.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 font-black">3</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Leak & Noise Recertification</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">Hydrostatic oil leak testing, vibration analysis, and test certificate issuance prior to dispatch.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Need Urgent Gearbox Repair or Overhaul?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium mb-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Contact our Vatva, Ahmedabad plant directly for rapid turnaround inspection and repair schedules.</p>
        <a href="tel:+919825083051" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-md transition-all hover:scale-105">Call Engineering Hotline: +91-9825083051</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
